# Keep secrets and local state out of an upload of this folder: Vercel does not read .gitignore. A CLI deploy of the
# crok-relay project (Root Directory relay) runs from the repository root, whose .vercelignore lists the same files.
.env
.env.*
.convex/
.phone-sim*.json
.vercel/
node_modules/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
